WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.750
Flow wraps one sphere.

00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:05.825
Subtract the stream, and leftover flow fades with distance.

00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:09.162
As spheres appear, their flows add up at the marked point.

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:13.286
Each sphere also sits in its neighbors' flow.

00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:17.107
Ignoring this, error peaks at the pair.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.993
Part Three fixes this with refinement.
